venv/


# Local survey / QGIS project files (do not commit field data)
*.gpkg
*.qgz
!samples/**/*.gpkg
!samples/**/*.qgz
# Old-version compatibility samples are synthetic surveys saved by that version's
# app code (no real site data). They must travel with the repo, or a fresh clone/CI
# cannot run save_open_portable::oldVersionSurveysStillOpen (tests/data/compat/README.md).
!tests/data/compat/**

# Account/key files: never commit, wherever a checkout, build or portable puts them.
config/secrets.ini
config/ngii-local.ini
config/*-local.ini
config/*-account.ini
**/config/*-local.ini
**/config/*-account.ini
**/secrets.ini
ka-hgis-vworld.ini

# CTest writes cost data next to the build; not source.
Testing/


# QGIS offline manuals: large Desktop User Guide PDFs stay local (see docs/vendor/qgis-manual-3.44/README.md)
docs/vendor/qgis-manual-3.44/QGIS-*-DesktopUserGuide-*.pdf

# 내부 개발 계획·실행 로그는 공개 저장소에 올리지 않는다.
